    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.35",
    "summary": "This unit can pass through models other than TITANIC ones during Normal, Advance and Fall Back moves. It can also cross terrain horizontally where the section is at most 4″ high. Choose to give every model in the unit MOBILE before it moves. If you choose MOBILE, it lasts until the move finishes, then a D6 roll of 1 leaves the unit Battle-shocked. See **[Terrain and Movement](vsdata:core-rule/terrain-and-movement)** for using MOBILE to cross dense terrain horizontally.",
